menu "CYD Palm"

config CYD_DEVTOOLS
    bool "Developer tools in the UI"
    default n
    help
        Compiles in the hooks the simulator's scripted tests use (UI_DEVTOOLS):
        typing into a field from a script, and Coach's invisible corner target
        that skips a running session to its end. Useful on a bench device that
        is being driven by a test; never wanted on a device someone uses --
        Coach's whole premise is that a session cannot be escaped.

endmenu
